t Cards?"}, {"type": "position", "content": 7}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 5}, {"type": "level", "content": "A1.1"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately exchange information about buying things in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.     "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.     "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " The Modal Can for Possibility"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "The modal <span class = \"strong\">can</span> is used to ask and talk about what is possible. <br/><span class = \"italic\">Example: I can buy him a tie!</span><br/>After a question, you do not need to repeat the information in the sentence."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Can you show me those ties? "}, {"type": "example", "content": "You can buy this scarf and that tie. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Can I try this on?"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " These and Those"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Demonstrative adjectives point something out. You use <span class = \"strong\">these</span> when things are close. You use <span class = \"strong\">those</span> when things are far.<br/>The demonstrative adjective goes in front of the noun.<br/><span class = \"italic\">these + noun (these ties)</span> or <span class = \"italic\">those + noun (those ties)</span>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":\"3\",\"columns\":\"3\",\"cells\":[\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Demonstrative Adjective\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"near<br/>(here)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"these(socks)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"italic\\\">These socks here are on sale.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"far<br/>(there)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"those(ties)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">I want to see those ties over there.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " You make the negative form by adding <span class=\"strong\">not</span> to the verb."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Those socks are <span class = \"strong\">not</span> on sale."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I do <span class = \"strong\">not</span> like those ties at the back."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "final sale"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "you cannot return a final sale item to the store for money or exchange"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: These shoes are final sale."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le05ob07aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use when items in shops are on sale."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to be on sale"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the price is reduced"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: These are on sale for 50% off."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le05ob07aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "purple"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a mix of red and blue"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Her bag is purple!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le05ob07aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "grey"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a mix of black and white"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The sky is grey. It looks like rain."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le05ob07aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "It suits you"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "it looks good on you"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: That color looks good on you. It suits you."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le05ob07aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to return"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to take back"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You cannot return this item."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le05ob07aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to try on"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to put on clothing in a store"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Can I try on this shirt, please?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le05ob07aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "on special"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "at a reduced price"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: These ties are on special this week."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le05ob07aud09"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to accept"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to take"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Do you accept credit cards?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le05ob07aud01"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn2le05ob07re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Look at a newspaper, magazine or look online."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Find 6 pieces of clothing or accessory items."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write 3 item names in English and the sale price on one paper."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write 3 item names and their sale prices on a second paper."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Put one paper in front of you."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Put the second paper far from you."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Say how much these/those items are. "}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I identify 6 items."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I express how near or far the items are in my sentences about clothing and accessories. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about the prices of items."}]}], "type": "sena"}